1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:04,040
Earth was the one who stopped you
from fighting, remember?

2
00:00:04,664 --> 00:00:05,864
Earth.

3
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,960
Earth?
Which Earth?

4
00:00:12,175 --> 00:00:15,610
Earth—my dad's wife's kid?

5
00:00:16,638 --> 00:00:17,870
Why are you so shocked?

6
00:00:18,726 --> 00:00:21,585
Yeah, that one.

7
00:00:21,585 --> 00:00:22,085
So…

8
00:00:24,358 --> 00:00:27,183
What the hell was that kid doing over there?

9
00:00:27,183 --> 00:00:29,615
Probably hanging out with his friends.

10
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,818
Are you awake yet? I need to clear the bill.

11
00:00:34,877 --> 00:00:39,815
Yeah, I'm up. Send it over—I'll settle it.

12
00:00:39,892 --> 00:00:41,370
Alright.

13
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:45,244
So… what are you gonna do about Base?

14
00:00:46,286 --> 00:00:46,786
Base?

15
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:51,625
What do you mean "Base"?
He stole my girl, Night!

16
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:54,101
Yeah, I know.

17
00:00:55,315 --> 00:00:59,020
But calm down, man.
If Maprang isn't into him,

18
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:01,260
Base can't do shit anyway.

19
00:01:02,782 --> 00:01:06,408
But Maprang is about to marry me, man!

20
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:28,319
What's with all the bags?
Why do you have so many?

21
00:01:28,993 --> 00:01:31,628
Are you okay?

22
00:01:31,628 --> 00:01:35,306
Why'd you bring a suitcase?
What happened to you?

23
00:01:38,350 --> 00:01:40,724
I'm fine.
Yeah.

24
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:46,660
I just… didn't have breakfast.

25
00:01:47,488 --> 00:01:50,586
It's okay, we'll go get something to eat.

26
00:01:51,376 --> 00:01:52,841
You get it, right?

27
00:01:53,188 --> 00:01:55,586
Man… when people don't welcome you,

28
00:01:55,586 --> 00:01:57,803
it's hard to stay there.

29
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:04,481
Do you know any place that's not too expensive?

30
00:02:06,311 --> 00:02:08,764
You could stay at my place first, you know.

31
00:02:10,170 --> 00:02:13,347
Nah, I'd feel bad. And what about BB?

32
00:02:13,983 --> 00:02:18,180
It's fine. BB has her own room.

33
00:02:18,488 --> 00:02:19,563
She doesn't come over every day.

34
00:02:20,218 --> 00:02:21,670
That's exactly it.

35
00:02:21,978 --> 00:02:24,314
You two should stay together properly.

36
00:02:24,564 --> 00:02:27,537
If I move in, how are you guys gonna be sweet?

37
00:02:27,711 --> 00:02:33,521
Bro, then I'll just go stay at BB's place. Easy.

38
00:02:33,521 --> 00:02:37,412
Alright, do that then.

39
00:02:37,412 --> 00:02:38,292
Thanks, man.

40
00:02:38,388 --> 00:02:39,533
Yeah.
